Standalone setup:
    1) Download selenium-server and place it somewhere
    2) Run below command prompt to start selenium grid - java-jar selenium-server-4.41.0.jar standalone
    3) URL to see session: http://localhost:4444/

Hub and Node Setup(Multiple machines)
    1) Download selenium-server and place it somewhere in both( hub and node).
    2) Run command
        java-jar selenium-server-4.41.0.jar hub

    3) Run below command to make machine as node
        java-jar selenium-server-4.41.0.jar node--hub http://<hub-ip>:4444

    4) URL: http://localhost:4444